{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_3","type":"command_execution","command":"\"C:\\\\Windows\\\\System32\\\\WindowsPowerShell\\\\v1.0\\\\powershell.exe\" -NoProfile -Command \"Get-Content -Raw -LiteralPath 'C:\\\\Users\\\\Asus\\\\.codex\\\\skills\\\\urdu-dua-ruqyah\\\\SKILL.md'\"","aggregated_output":"---\nname: urdu-dua-ruqyah\ndescription: Complete, review, track, and build the Urdu Dua & Ruqyah SQLite translation in G:\\dua-ruqyah. Use for Urdu translation, Urdu language QA, coverage audits, work-status updates, and final database builds for this project; it requires every user-visible section, including nested and app/book content.\n---\n\n# Urdu Dua & Ruqyah\n\nProduce idiomatic, dignified Urdu across the complete database. A filled target is not automatically a good translation, and a completed `duas` table is not a completed database.\n\n## Required context\n\nBefore changing translations, read:\n\n- [references/project-scope.md](references/project-scope.md) for every required table, source, field, and completion gate.\n- [references/urdu-style.md](references/urdu-style.md) for the Urdu register and review standard.\n- `G:\\dua-ruqyah\\dua_main_ur_translation\\GLOSSARY.json` and the relevant source row.\n\nTreat existing changes in `dua_main_ur_translation` as user work. Never regenerate or replace `work/`, `source/`, or metadata merely to add omitted tables. Extend the workspace without losing completed chunks or glossary decisions.\n\n## Start and finish with status\n\nRun the bundled status audit before and after material work:\n\n```powershell\npython scripts/work_status.py --workspace \"G:\\dua-ruqyah\\dua_main_ur_translation\" --write\n```\n\nRun it from this skill directory, or pass the script's absolute path. It writes `WORK_STATUS.md` in the Urdu workspace and exposes required tables missing from the current chunk index. Do not report the percentage for the partial index as whole-project completion.\n\n## Translation workflow\n\n1. Identify the first incomplete or omitted required table from `WORK_STATUS.md`.\n2. If scope is missing, add chunks and metadata for only those missing tables. Do not run a destructive generator over translated files.\n3. Translate one manageable chunk at a time. Edit only target text and permitted status/review metadata.\n4. Read English and Bengali context when both exist. Follow the source routing in `project-scope.md`; resolve a real conflict from Arabic or the cited primary text and record the decision in `GLOSSARY.json` overrides.\n5. Translate nested `duas.groups` and structured `drawer_items.content`; these are user-visible text.\n6. Run `python scripts/verify.py <chunk>` from the Urdu workspace. Correct every error.\n7. Perform a separate naturalness pass against `urdu-style.md`. Mark a chunk done only after semantic, structural, and Urdu-quality review.\n8. Update `PLAN.md` where it already tracks the chunk, and regenerate `WORK_STATUS.md`. Status must come from the files, not optimistic prose.\n\nDo not silently alter Arabic, IDs, keys, links, audio, counts, HTML structure, reference numbers, transliteration, or nullness. Inline and top-level references remain normalized English with ASCII digits. Preserve all source numbers, converting Bengali/Arabic digit glyphs to ASCII without changing their values.\n\n## Completion and build gate\n\nNever build or say ├óΓé¼┼ôcomplete├óΓé¼┬¥ while any of these is true:\n\n- a required text-bearing table is absent from the work index;\n- any target or nested target is blank;\n- a chunk has not passed structural verification and a natural-Urdu review;\n- Bengali prose or unintended English source prose remains in user-visible fields;\n- glossary spellings, honorifics, names, numbers, Arabic, HTML, keys, or nullness are inconsistent;\n- books, book details, sections, drawer screens, or nested dua groups were excluded;\n- final row counts/schema differ from their routed source tables.\n\nWhen all gates pass, run the full verifier and build without `--partial`:\n\n```powershell\npython scripts/verify.py\npython scripts/build.py ur\n```\n\nThen require `PRAGMA integrity_check = ok`, compare every table's row count and primary-key set with its designated source, scan all user-visible fields for Bengali residue and blank targets, and record the database path and verification date in `WORK_STATUS.md`.\n\r\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
